{"schemaVersion":"1.0.0","commitSha":"c2534ff9c84422e00711da31629a76f3f59feb98","shard":"4339647fc9175fd7","symbols":[{"path":"xrpl/LoanDefaultFreezeExemptAccounts","kind":"struct","name":"LoanDefaultFreezeExemptAccounts","qualifiedName":"xrpl::LoanDefaultFreezeExemptAccounts","scope":"xrpl","category":"production","access":"public","documentation":{"status":"present","brief":[{"type":"text","text":"The accounts and asset that "},{"type":"link","text":"LoanManage::defaultLoan","target":{"path":"xrpl/LoanManage/defaultLoan/1c23df29","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":"'s fixCleanup3_4_0 freeze/lock exemption applies to."}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"defaultLoan moves funds from the LoanBroker pseudo-account to the Vault pseudo-account via accountSend. Since neither is the vault asset's issuer, this is a third-party transfer that transits through the issuer in two hops (broker -> issuer, issuer -> vault; see directSendNoLimitIOU/directSendNoLimitMPT), so the exemption must cover both the issuer/broker and issuer/vault pairs, not a direct broker/vault pair. asset scopes it further to the vault's own currency/MPT issuance, so an unrelated one the same accounts happen to hold is still protected."}]}],"returns":null,"notes":[],"suppressionReason":null,"inheritedFrom":null},"location":{"declaration":{"file":"include/xrpl/ledger/helpers/LendingHelpers.h","line":152},"definition":{"file":"include/xrpl/ledger/helpers/LendingHelpers.h","line":153,"endLine":158}},"corrections":[],"templateParameters":null,"isTemplateSpecialization":false,"isFinal":false,"isAbstract":false,"baseClasses":[],"derivedClasses":[],"friends":[],"deductionGuides":[],"nested":[],"members":["xrpl/LoanDefaultFreezeExemptAccounts/issuer","xrpl/LoanDefaultFreezeExemptAccounts/broker","xrpl/LoanDefaultFreezeExemptAccounts/vault","xrpl/LoanDefaultFreezeExemptAccounts/asset"],"declaration":[{"text":"struct LoanDefaultFreezeExemptAccounts"}]},{"path":"xrpl/L